  "public_instruction": "Get the living room ready for movie night for two and put everything else away.",
  "public_context": [
    "Movie night for two calls for cooked popcorn in its bag and two cups, two plates, and two forks on the living-room coffee table. The raw popcorn bag is in the kitchen; use the microwave. The microwave must be switched off before the cooked bag leaves it and must finish off and closed.",
    "The coffee table is ready for food only after it has been cleared of clutter and dusted with the cleaning brush, before any food or dining items are set on it.",
    "The three soda cans are trash for the bin; the two toy figures belong inside the toy box. The brush belongs back on the kitchen counter where it started. The final coffee table should be clean, with the cooked popcorn and all six dining items set out."
